:"Nyanza | OP Autofarm + Serverhop","game":{"_id":"692f08b6f0170c0a5183e55d","gameId":14438406081,"name":"Wanted [🏍️UPDATE]","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-fdd1f9cdbec1c85f0c3574c970ddeae0-2ea47b4e4954.png","placeId":14438406081},"features":"Nyanza script for Wanted\nFully autonomous multi-target Wanted money autofarm with serverhop.\nSelect your targets, press Start and walk away.\n\nBank Vault\n\nAutomatically obtains C4, opens the vault and collects main cash, pallets and all items. Handles the 20-minute bank reset automatically.\n\nJewelry\n\nClears jewelry cases and the vault. Optional Vault Cracker automatically buys, installs and operates the drill.\n\nVault Cracker (a Jewelry add-on)\n\nIf the vault is locked, it automatically buys a drill at the port, attaches it to the door, drill and automatically un-jam it, and then empties the vault. Meanwhile, it continues smashing standard display cases.\n\nMilitary Chests\n\nFarms military chests at the Fort Emberreach and automatically collected weapons at Rod.\n\nSafes\n\nAutomatically opens safes through the backdoor without the keypad minigame.\n\nATMs\n\nAutomatically farms ATMs across the map.\n\nCash Registers\n\nAutomatically farms cash registers throughout downtown.\n\nSir B Sales\n\nSells bags to Sir B first for 2× the normal payout. Sir B sales have a ~4-hour payout delay, and the sales limit resets after 4 hours. Once the Black Market sales limit is reached, remaining bags are automatically sold to Ofy. Requires a Level 2 Agent.\n\nIncognito Mode\n\nAutomatically purchases Incognito from the Syndicate Agent once at the start of farming. Cost and duration scale with your Incognito level. Incognito mode resets when server hopping.\n\nAll collected items are automatically sold according to your selected sales settings when the bag is full.\n\nAUTOMATION HELPERS\n\nDeath Recovery\nRecovers your dropped bag after death and resumes farming.\n\nDamage Evade\nBreaks contact and repositions when taking damage.\n\nAuto-Reconnect\nReconnects after connection loss or timeout and resumes farming.\n\nGame State\nSkips already-looted locations and tracks bank reset timers.\n\nMovement\nControlled fast teleport what bypasses Wanted AC with grounded movement for close-range actions.","tags":["wanted","wanted autofarm","autofarm","serverhop","wanted script"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nyanzadev/Nyanza/refs/heads/main/loader\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a8485d823eea3725461e1e0","username":"Nyanza","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a8485d823eea3725461e1e0-1787069944139.png","status":"offline","id":"6a8485d823eea3725461e1e0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.com/invite/hRC7XpFKJE","keyLink":"https://ads.pandauth.com/getkey/nyanza","views":6096,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/14438406081-1787696352603.jpg","likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-08-25T22:19:12.621Z","executes":14485,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":10926,"at":"2026-09-29T05:45:00.006Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a8e14e0813480dd8db8f9f0","editBy":{"_id":"6a8485d823eea3725461e1e0","username":"Nyanza","status":"offline","id":"6a8485d823eea3725461e1e0"},"message":"Uploaded script","createdAt":"2026-08-25T22:19:12.624Z"}],"comments":[]},{"slug":"Wanted-N-hub-86694","_id":"696b456ef3dbd103e3b3c312","title":"OP script: Resolver Hub: Silent aim , Auto Farm ,Auto Arrest","game":{"_id":"692f08b6f0170c0a5183e55d","gameId":14438406081,"name":"Wanted [🏍️UPDATE]","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-fdd1f9cdbec1c85f0c3574c970ddeae0-2ea47b4e4954.png","placeId":14438406081},"features":"-- https://discord.gg/GhwYCucv4z \n+ Silent Aim\n+ Instant Hit\n+ Insure hit { makes you hit the target even if you missed } \n+ Fov Radius slider - Thickness Slider -